WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.209
This is the technical deep
dive for Book 02 of the

2
00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:07.000
Federal Modernization Workbook,
Identity and Directory.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.197
It's for the architects and
engineers who will actually

4
00:00:10.197 --> 00:00:13.463
run the move from Active
Directory to Microsoft Entra ID.

5
00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:16.536
It comes in two parts of about
twenty-five minutes each,

6
00:00:16.536 --> 00:00:18.926
and four modules you can watch separately.

7
00:00:18.926 --> 00:00:20.723
Part 1 is assessing the forest:

8
00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:24.824
first what a standard account can
learn without any elevated access,

9
00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:29.212
then the full privileged assessment
and the evidence pipeline behind it.

10
00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:34.016
Part 2 is building the Entra ID target
and migrating onto it: the sync, sign-in,

11
00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:38.976
group, service account, privileged
access and Conditional Access decisions,

12
00:00:38.976 --> 00:00:41.765
then governance, the
eleven-phase playbook,

13
00:00:41.765 --> 00:00:46.337
and a reference deployment that shows
the whole sequence on one estate.

14
00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:50.087
The slides show tables,
flows and decision matrices.

15
00:00:50.087 --> 00:00:52.781
The code lives in the
chapters and appendices;

16
00:00:52.781 --> 00:00:55.540
I'll point you to it rather
than put it on screen.
